    "reviews": "\u201cSince a few days on Steam Greenlight, Radical Fiction's Hard Times was this year's DIY surprise.\u201d<br>Everyeye<br><br>\u201cWe will put you to the test, in these Hard Times ...\u201d<br>Vita Extra<br><br>\u201cThe difficulty of the homeless's life is well suited to the genre, and the authors' personal experience is the basis for a video game that wants to be mechanically playful but also wants to denounce the indifference of society towards a parallel and invisible world that attracts our attention only for matters of decorum and public order.\u201d<br>WebTrek<br>",
